Visual Mood: cold silver-blue monochrome; low-key lighting; shallow depth; breathing reflections; liquid glass
Setting: bedroom lined with mirrors whose surfaces behave as fluid membranes while the air remains perfectly dry
Protagonist: Young woman, in her mid 30s, dressing in pajamas; long dark hair; very expressive eyes
